      "message": "Setting `isSetRunningDuringCancellation` to `true` for READY/PARKED would duplicate the removal already handled in the finally block of `run()`, since `run()` is in flight in those states. We set it to true only when the state is `null`, i.e. `run()` never started, so `cancel()` has to handle the removal itself.",
